    "title": "Jimmy Pesto's Pizzeria",
    "body": "The flashy Italian restaurant directly across Ocean Avenue from Bob's Burgers, run by Bob's self-appointed arch-rival **Jimmy Pesto**.\n\n## The Menu Board\nA big glossy menu board — everything has a theme name and nothing is as good as it sounds. Unlike the hand-chalked **Burger of the Day** board across the street, Jimmy's menu never changes. Style over substance is kind of the whole point.\n\n## Notes\n- Home turf of Jimmy Jr., Andy, and Ollie Pesto\n- The Bob-versus-Jimmy feud drives episodes from the burger cook-off to the table-scoring wars\n- Known more for gimmicks and karaoke nights than for the actual food"
